      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "caregiver",
      "transcript_text": "No, I've checked every morning. Never above normal.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:48",
      "end_timestamp": "00:53",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Any vomiting or diarrhoea?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:54",
      "end_timestamp": "00:57",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "caregiver",
      "transcript_text": "No, nothing like that.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:58",
      "end_timestamp": "01:01",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Does Mia have any allergies, including to foods?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:03",
      "end_timestamp": "01:08",
      "supports": [
        "allergies[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "caregiver",
      "transcript_text": "Egg. She came out in hives and was sick after a bit of scrambled egg at her last foster home, so they told me to be careful.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:10",
      "end_timestamp": "01:24",
      "supports": [
        "allergies[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Thank you, that's important, and it's fine for the jabs we're giving, we'll check. Any other history?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:26",
      "end_timestamp": "01:34",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "caregiver",
      "transcript_text": "Eczema, on her cheeks and the backs of her knees. It's mild.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:36",
      "end_timestamp": "01:42",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Her chest is clear, and ears are both normal. The nose is just a bit runny. I can't rule out a brewing ear infection on that left side, but there's no sign yet.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:29",
      "end_timestamp": "02:47",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Four, but quick, and Priya's very good. I'd like to arrange for you to wait fifteen minutes in the waiting room afterwards, so we can check she's well.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:31",
      "end_timestamp": "03:45",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Well done, Mia. Pauline, she may be grumpy and a bit warm for a day or two, and she may have a sore leg.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:29",
      "end_timestamp": "04:42",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "If she gets a high temperature, a rash that doesn't fade, or a swollen face, or if she's floppy or won't feed, call 999 or come back straight away.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:07",
      "end_timestamp": "05:20",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Her next appointment is at three years, and the practice will send it. I'd like to see her again before then if the ear gets worse.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:26",
      "end_timestamp": "05:39",
